  "idea": "Calibre: the ultimate free eBook manager and format converter",
  "text": "Stop dealing with incompatible eBook formats on your phone and tablet. You download an essential PDF guide or manual, only to find your reading app rejects the extension. Closed digital ecosystems intentionally restrict file transfers between Kindle, Kobo, and iPad devices. Calibre instantly converts entire batches of documents into tailored EPUB or MOBI files with calibrated font sizing. You get seamless cross-platform reading without buying duplicate copies.",
